      "thinking": "Turn 2. My hand: Earth King's Lieutenant (GW), Forest, Hakoda (3W), Island, Katara Water Tribe's Hope (2WUU), Katara the Fearless (GWU), Plains, Pretending Poxbearers (1W/B).\n\
\n\
