\n\
Alternatively play Plains to cast Pretending Poxbearers (1W/B — I can pay 1W = Plains+Plains). Poxbearers is a 2/1 for 2 that makes a token when it dies.\n\
\n\
Options:\n\
- Forest + Earth King's Lieutenant: 1/1 trample now, grows as more allies enter.\n\
- Plains + Poxbearers: 2/1 now.\n\
\n\
