\n\
Plan: T2 Forest + Lieutenant. T3 Island + Katara the Fearless (then Lieutenant triggers twice when another ally enters... actually Katara the Fearless is itself an Ally? \"Katara, the Fearless\" — likely an Ally. When Katara enters, Lieutenant's \"whenever another Ally enters\" triggers, and Katara's doubling would apply? The doubling is a replacement-ish \"triggers an additional time\" — if Katara is on the battlefield when the trigger happens. When Katara herself enters, Lieutenant triggers; Katara is already on the battlefield at that point, so it triggers twice. Lieutenant gets two +1/+1 counters → becomes 3/3 trample. Nice.\n\
\n\
So play Forest, cast Earth King's Lieutenant.\n\
\n\
