\n\
Go with Ascension → Lieutenant → attack all.\n\
\n\
Order of casting: Ascension first so Lieutenant's ETB adds a quest counter to it. If I cast Lieutenant first, Ascension wouldn't get the counter from Lieutenant. So Ascension first definitely.\n\
\n\
Airbend target: Ostrich-Horse (biggest threat, 4/2). Also removes a blocker. Long Feng stays as 2/3 blocker.\n\
\n\
