\n\
3. Airbender Ascension's quest counter trigger: \"Whenever a creature you control enters, put a quest counter on this.\" That adds a 5th quest counter.\n\
\n\
So three triggers need ordering. All will resolve regardless of order, so ordering is inconsequential. Just pick one. p94, p95, p96 — I don't know which is which, but it doesn't matter. Let me pick p94.\n\
\n\
