      "reasoning": "Both at 14 life, and their whole board is tapped from the attack. I have exactly 5 mana for Katara, Water Tribe's Hope — she'll double-trigger South Pole Voyager (life + card), then Airbender Ascension's end-step blink re-triggers her for another token. That's a huge value turn while they're defenseless.",
