Their creatures are all tapped. If I attack now with South Pole Voyager 2/2 and Ally Token 2/2, they can't block, that's 4 damage → they'd go to 10. But wait, it's precombat main. I could cast a spell first.\n\
\n\
Casting Katara, Water Tribe's Hope: costs {2}{W}{U}{U} = 5 mana. I have exactly 5: Plains, Plains (WW), Island (U), North Pole Gates (U), Forest... wait Forest is G. Let me count: 2 Plains = WW, Island = U, North Pole Gates = U (or W), Forest = G. Katara needs 2 generic + W + U + U. So: WW from... hmm, {2}{W}{U}{U}: I can pay generic 2 with Forest + one Plains, W with other Plains, UU with Island + Gates. Yes, exactly 5 mana. That taps me out.\n\
