      "chosen_args": {
        "blockers": "p3:p15",
        "summary": "Opponent attacked with Long Feng 5/6 trample and the earthbent Swamp 4/4. I'm blocking the Swamp with Earth King's Lieutenant (it dies, but the Swamp has no trample so nothing extra gets through), taking 5 from Long Feng to go from 19 to 14. Keeping South Pole Voyager alive for the Airbender Ascension blink engine (card draw + life gain), with Hakoda in hand as an indestructible button against future trample attacks.",
        "rationale": "Blocking the 4/4 Swamp (no trample) with Lieutenant minimizes damage (5 from Long Feng vs 6+ any other way) while preserving Voyager, whose blink triggers draw cards and gain life — my best engine in a long grind against their big blockers. Lieutenant's trample is nice but it can't profitably attack into Long Feng 5/6 anyway, so it's the expendable piece here.",
      },
