        "provider": "OpenAI",
        "explanation": "Ba Sing Se turns spare mana into a steady stream of 2/2 creatures without costing additional cards, and the animated lands return if they die or are exiled. That repeatable advantage on a land makes it a powerful, low-opportunity-cost first pick.",
